    "Name": "Tarantula Hovertank",
    "Details": "The ad campaign for this thing went 'Spiders have eight legs, the Tarantula has eight lasers. You do the math!' No one knew what that meant. Really dumb advertisement. Great hovertank, especially for the price.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       120     20\n<b>Left</b>         100     20\n<b>Right</b>       100     20\n<b>Rear</b>         80     20\n<b>Turret</b>      110     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      510    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Laser</color>",
